  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Havindustritilsynet  frame agreement Energy for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Havindustritilsynet/The Norwegian Ocean Industry Authority will provide technical assistance and capacity building to government institutions in partner countries under the Energy for Development Program (EfD), aimed at reducing emissions from energy (petroleum) production, mainly flaring and methane emissions.
This includes capacity building on effective technical solutions for reducing climate gas emissions, including preventing fugitive emissions, effective rules and regulations on emissions to air, CO2 pricing and taxes, infrastructure requirements for handling associated gas, measuring emissions, reporting requirements, data collection and monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
